<head>
    <meta name="description" content="About the Dreego plugin showcase">
</head>

<go>
    heading := "About This Demo"
</go>

<div>
    <section class="py-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-6">{{ heading }}</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8">This is a Dreego web application that demonstrates the plugin ecosystem. It uses three runtime plugins and one build-time plugin:</p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                        <span class="text-xl" aria-hidden="true">🔌</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">plugin-example</h2>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">A greeting and health endpoint. Demonstrates typed Options, route registration, and optional middleware.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                        <span class="text-xl" aria-hidden="true">📡</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">plugin-sse</h2>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Server-Sent Events for real-time server-to-client streaming. Uses Go standard library only — no external dependencies.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                        <span class="text-xl" aria-hidden="true">⚡</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">plugin-websocket</h2>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">WebSocket for bidirectional real-time communication. Implements RFC 6455 with the Go standard library — no gorilla/websocket or other external packages.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-xl border border-amber-200">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-amber-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                        <span class="text-xl" aria-hidden="true">🎨</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">plugin-tailwind</h2>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Build-time plugin that compiles Tailwind CSS during <code class="text-xs bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">dreego build</code>. No Node.js needed at runtime — the CSS is embedded in the Go binary.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-slate-600 mt-8">All runtime plugins use the Go standard library only. The app is a single binary with no runtime external dependencies.</p>
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-6 text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 font-medium">← Back to home</a>
    </section>
</div>